<title>RUSSIA: Armenian premier resigns while in London.</title>
<headline>Armenian premier resigns while in London.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Armenian Prime Minister Armen Sarkisyan offered his resignation on Friday during a trip to London for health treatment, Itar-Tass news agency said.</p>
<p>The agency said Sarkisyan, 44, appointed only last November, announced his decision while talking to Armenian journalists by telephone. Tass did not say whether his resignation had been accepted.</p>
</text>
